<title>USA: Smith Barney wins Connecticut $150 mln GO bonds.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney wins Connecticut $150 mln GO bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $150 million of State of Connecticut general obligation bonds, 1997 Series A, with a true interest cost of 5.2778 percent.</p>
</text>
